model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "A native grant without models asks the pool nothing: carry 0681's per-check pool device check and its pool-access refusal apply only to grants with models. A tools-only grant's access checks, token issuance and refreshes, and tool calls are decided by the grant, its consent and token rows and live membership in its tools organization, so they keep working while the pool's control plane fails. A revoked tools-only grant is refused at once by the tools gateway's per-call reads of its tool calls, and by a remembered access answer within carry 0681's 3-second bound. Its access answer's display carries the account and the grant's pool id with an empty name and no pool choices. A grant with models still asks the pool on every check, refresh and tool call, and the pool's outage refuses it as unavailable."
    }
  }
}
